    <note>
        This model was created using publicly available data, publicly available
        technical reports, textbooks, and guesses. It contains no proprietary or
        restricted data. If this model has been validated at all, it would be
        only to the extent that it seems to "fly right", and that it possibly
        complies with published, publicly known, performance data (maximum speed,
        endurance, etc.). Thus, this model is meant for educational and entertainment
        purposes only.

        This simulation model is not endorsed by the manufacturer. This model is not
        to be sold.
      </note>
    <note>QuestFlight SGS 2-33A REFERENCE_CONFIGURATION. G2EA Rev4 control limits and datum; estimated empty CG, inertia, hook and vertical contacts. Not operator-exact or validated handling.</note>
    <note>Reference polar calibrated with an estimated cambered profile-drag bucket plus induced drag. Manual points support calm glides only; estimated CL peak, post-stall continuation and airbrake increment are not independently validated.</note>
